            "auth": {
              "type": "apikey",
              "key": "x-api-key",
              "value": "{{x-api-key}}",
              "placement": "header"
            }
          },
          "docs": "> ⚠️ **Sandbox & development only.** Simulation endpoints are not available in production and return `404 Not Found` there.\n\nApproves a submitted onboarding application in the sandbox as if the compliance review had passed, and kicks off checking-account onboarding for the selected product. Every representative must have passed identity verification (`kyc_status` is `approved`) first: like real review, the simulation will not approve an application whose beneficial owner failed KYC, and returns "
        },
