          "docs": "> ⚠️ **Sandbox & development only.** Simulation endpoints are not available in production and return `404 Not Found` there.\n\nSimulates an inbound ACH, wire, RTP, or FedNow transfer into a cash account in the sandbox. Only cash accounts support this simulation."
